# OpenCarrusel agent

This repo is a local Instagram carousel editor (Next.js, localhost:3000).

When the user asks to create or edit carousels, slides, or Instagram ads:

1. Read `.cursor/skills/open-carrusel/SKILL.md` and `.cursor/skills/sn-ppt-standard/SKILL.md`.
2. Use `pnpm oc --` for create/add/delete/export. Edit `data/slides/<carouselId>/<slideId>.html` for visual design.
3. Keep the dev server running; the preview polls for file changes.
4. One idea per slide. Clean editable HTML. No generic AI type, color, or copy.
